// Moves for B05, the Ossuary Keeper (registry 34100-34199). Source:
// docs/game/05-enemies-and-bosses.md, "B05 Ossuary Keeper": a bell swing combo, a lantern beam
// (sweeping, 24-tick charge), and Raise (up to three skeletons from the floor). Phase 2 adds the
// water's surge, the scavenge, and the two borrowed weapon moves. Damage comes from the body's
// `attack` (and `element_attack` for the beam), so `motion_value` is the only multiplier. Every
// attack telegraphs for at least 12 frames and every combo ends in at least 20 frames of
// recovery (checked by `lf_content::boss::check`). Hit and frame numbers are tuning.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
[
